# E27_NodeOS: plugins are compiled live by the running host, never by this project's own build -
# the DLL/obj/lib/log/batch output has no business in source control. Debug log and undo-history
# store are runtime output too. graph.txt IS checked in on purpose - it's the example graph a first
# run opens with, not scratch output (see its own history for why this changed).
